  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Herzing College is a private career college with campuses across Canada, including in Montreal and Ottawa. Founded in 1965 in Montreal, Herzing offers diploma programs in business, technology, healthcare, and design, focused on quick career entry for graduates.",
      "Programs at Herzing are typically one year in length, making them an efficient pathway for international students seeking Canadian work experience and qualifications. The college's career-focused model includes strong ties to local employers and co-op or practicum placements.",
